{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Your Piece and Begin the Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a board full of unique 3D puzzle pieces and select the one you think fits next. Each animal model has its own set of piece boards, so look carefully to find the right match. Once selected, the piece comes to life and moves smoothly into the action area, ready for you to work your magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d4ae2a4f4b7cd8a7b8e4238b86804a67.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d4ae2a4f4b7cd8a7b8e4238b86804a67.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d4ae2a4f4b7cd8a7b8e4238b86804a67.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate, Twist, and Align with Precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just drag and drop \u2014 every piece needs to be rotated across different axes to fit perfectly. Master 3D manipulation as you explore every angle, testing your spatial awareness. Can you find the exact orientation to make it snap into place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/e85ff90b4426982f59d6c180ab6c42be.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/e85ff90b4426982f59d6c180ab6c42be.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/e85ff90b4426982f59d6c180ab6c42be.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the Assembly Guide for Help</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a hint? Activate the assembly guide! It shows you the exact position of each piece, helping you compare, plan, and place with confidence. Perfect for players who want a relaxing experience or aim to sharpen their assembly skills and beat their best times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d208d303ddea2644b4a50dafcb8818a9.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d208d303ddea2644b4a50dafcb8818a9.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d208d303ddea2644b4a50dafcb8818a9.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble in Order and Search Across Boards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal puzzle follows a specific building order, and pieces must be placed step by step. As you progress, you\u2019ll need to explore multiple boards to locate the next required part. Stay organized and focused \u2014 the right piece is waiting somewhere on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/17aea14b226450877656794229b5bd14.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/17aea14b226450877656794229b5bd14.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/17aea14b226450877656794229b5bd14.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag It In and Complete Your Masterpiece</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it\u2019s properly rotated and ready, drag the piece into place and watch it snap perfectly into the 3D model. With every added piece, your animal creation takes shape. Complete them all and admire your finished masterpiece \u2014 crafted by your skill and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/55a5187df224b8e3b3161fb0bc8bb65c.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/55a5187df224b8e3b3161fb0bc8bb65c.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/55a5187df224b8e3b3161fb0bc8bb65c.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802610?t=1772814504","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/d55e4a7ab5e83affcbf5d48eae01678942de26ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772814504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/c9f683bceac1f718d4729ce49b527abefb14a353/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772814504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/c9f683bceac1f718d4729ce49b527abefb14a353/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772814504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3819520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Your Piece and Begin the Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a board full of unique 3D puzzle pieces and select the one you think fits next. Each animal model has its own set of piece boards, so look carefully to find the right match. Once selected, the piece comes to life and moves smoothly into the action area, ready for you to work your magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d4ae2a4f4b7cd8a7b8e4238b86804a67.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d4ae2a4f4b7cd8a7b8e4238b86804a67.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d4ae2a4f4b7cd8a7b8e4238b86804a67.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate, Twist, and Align with Precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just drag and drop \u2014 every piece needs to be rotated across different axes to fit perfectly. Master 3D manipulation as you explore every angle, testing your spatial awareness. Can you find the exact orientation to make it snap into place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/e85ff90b4426982f59d6c180ab6c42be.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/e85ff90b4426982f59d6c180ab6c42be.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/e85ff90b4426982f59d6c180ab6c42be.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the Assembly Guide for Help</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a hint? Activate the assembly guide! It shows you the exact position of each piece, helping you compare, plan, and place with confidence. Perfect for players who want a relaxing experience or aim to sharpen their assembly skills and beat their best times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d208d303ddea2644b4a50dafcb8818a9.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d208d303ddea2644b4a50dafcb8818a9.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/d208d303ddea2644b4a50dafcb8818a9.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble in Order and Search Across Boards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal puzzle follows a specific building order, and pieces must be placed step by step. As you progress, you\u2019ll need to explore multiple boards to locate the next required part. Stay organized and focused \u2014 the right piece is waiting somewhere on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/17aea14b226450877656794229b5bd14.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/17aea14b226450877656794229b5bd14.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/17aea14b226450877656794229b5bd14.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag It In and Complete Your Masterpiece</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it\u2019s properly rotated and ready, drag the piece into place and watch it snap perfectly into the 3D model. With every added piece, your animal creation takes shape. Complete them all and admire your finished masterpiece \u2014 crafted by your skill and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/55a5187df224b8e3b3161fb0bc8bb65c.poster.avif?t=1772814504\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/55a5187df224b8e3b3161fb0bc8bb65c.webm?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/extras/55a5187df224b8e3b3161fb0bc8bb65c.mp4?t=1772814504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Dazard Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802610/cd7593bc0085d02001a84ad64041f0d3a6b6f92c/header.jpg?t=1772814504","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3802610/1144680525/bb030563f010bb4c77fb3fb3c6938179fe088e03/1772807132/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772814502","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3802610/1144680525/bb030563f010bb4c77fb3fb3c6938179fe088e03/1772807132/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772814502","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3802610/1144680525/bb030563f010bb4c77fb3fb3c6938179fe088e03/